{"seq":1,"slug":"ongoing-monitoring-change-rescreen","title":"工商变更/存续状态持续监控与重审","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-kyb-business-verification/kyb-monitoring-lifecycle/ongoing-monitoring-change-rescreen","wordCount":2465,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"工商变更-存续状态持续监控与重审\">工商变更/存续状态持续监控与重审</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前八篇的所有核验都发生在<strong>一个时点</strong>上。时点核验的隐含假设是&quot;事实不会变&quot;，而公司是会变的：它改名、换董事、迁址、增资、被收购、被除名。一个在 3 月完全合规的商家，可能在 8 月被登记机关吊销了执照，而平台如果只在入驻时查过一次，就会在完全不知情的情况下继续给它结算货款。</p>\n<p>持续监控要解决的就是这个时间差。它的工程本质是：<strong>把一个登记主体的关键字段变成一份订阅，把变化变成事件，再把事件映射成重审动作。</strong> 三个环节各自都有陷阱——订阅什么决定漏检率，变化如何检测决定延迟，重审深度决定成本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[登记主体 + 字段清单] --&gt; B[定期拉取快照]&#10;  B --&gt; C[与上一版快照 diff]&#10;  C --&gt; D{字段是否变化?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[更新 last_checked_at]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F[生成变更事件]&#10;  F --&gt; G[变更分类]&#10;  G --&gt; H{变更类型}&#10;  H --&gt;|名称/地址| I[轻量重审]&#10;  H --&gt;|董事/股东/UBO| J[中度重审 + 重筛]&#10;  H --&gt;|状态 = 吊销/注销| K[重度: 联动处置]&#10;  H --&gt;|经营范围| L[类目决策重算]&#10;  I --&gt; M[更新尽调档案]&#10;  J --&gt; M&#10;  K --&gt; N[商家状态变更]&#10;  L --&gt; M\">graph TD\n  A[登记主体 + 字段清单] --&gt; B[定期拉取快照]\n  B --&gt; C[与上一版快照 diff]\n  C --&gt; D{字段是否变化?}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[更新 last_checked_at]\n  D --&gt;|是| F[生成变更事件]\n  F --&gt; G[变更分类]\n  G --&gt; H{变更类型}\n  H --&gt;|名称/地址| I[轻量重审]\n  H --&gt;|董事/股东/UBO| J[中度重审 + 重筛]\n  H --&gt;|状态 = 吊销/注销| K[重度: 联动处置]\n  H --&gt;|经营范围| L[类目决策重算]\n  I --&gt; M[更新尽调档案]\n  J --&gt; M\n  K --&gt; N[商家状态变更]\n  L --&gt; M</pre><h2 id=\"订阅什么-字段清单决定漏检率\">订阅什么：字段清单决定漏检率</h2><h3 id=\"必订字段与变更后果\">必订字段与变更后果</h3><p>不是所有登记字段都值得订阅，但漏订一个高风险字段的代价远高于多订几个低风险字段的成本。字段清单应当按&quot;变更后的合规后果&quot;分级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>变更后的后果</th>\n<th>重审深度</th>\n<th>是否触发重筛</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存续状态</td>\n<td>吊销/注销 → 主体资格消失</td>\n<td>重度（联动处置）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法定名称</td>\n<td>合同/发票主体名称不符</td>\n<td>轻量</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注册地址</td>\n<td>司法管辖区可能变化（制裁/税务）</td>\n<td>中度</td>\n<td>是（管辖区变化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>董事/高管</td>\n<td>控制结构可能变化</td>\n<td>中度</td>\n<td>是（新增人员需筛查）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>股东/持股比例</td>\n<td>UBO 可能跨过或跌破阈值</td>\n<td>中度（重跑穿透）</td>\n<td>是（新增 UBO）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经营范围</td>\n<td>类目授权可能失效或新增</td>\n<td>中（重算类目决策）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注册资本</td>\n<td>影响信用评估，不直接影响合规</td>\n<td>轻量（记录）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>许可证/资质有效期</td>\n<td>经营资格到期</td>\n<td>中度（联动类目下架）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键在于**&quot;是否触发重筛&quot;这一列**：人员与控制结构的变化必须触发筛查，因为 <a href=\"../ubo-controller-due-diligence/ubo-sanctions-aml-interface\">UBO 与制裁/AML 筛查接口</a> 的结论只在筛查时点有效。新董事上任不筛查，等于为一个未经核验的人开通了对平台的访问权限。</p>\n<h3 id=\"存续状态的取值语义\">存续状态的取值语义</h3><p>&quot;存续状态&quot;这个字段最容易出问题的地方是<strong>取值语义没有对齐</strong>。不同登记机关的状态枚举不同（active / dissolved / struck off / liquidation / administration / dormant），而这些词的法律含义并不一一对应。dormant（休眠）在有些管辖区是<strong>合法且正常</strong>的状态（不经营但不违法），把它等同于&quot;停业&quot;会造成批量误伤。</p>\n<p>工程上的做法是：<strong>在来源侧保留原始值，在平台侧映射到一套受控词表</strong>，并保留原始值以便复查。受控词表建议至少区分：<code>active</code>（正常存续）、<code>dormant_legal</code>（合法休眠）、<code>insolvency_process</code>（破产/重整程序中）、<code>dissolved</code>（已解散）、<code>struck_off</code>（被除名）、<code>unknown</code>（无法判定）。<code>unknown</code> 必须存在——把无法判定的情形强行归入 active 或 dissolved 都会产生系统性错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变化检测-快照-diff-的工程细节\">变化检测：快照 diff 的工程细节</h2><h3 id=\"拉取频率与成本\">拉取频率与成本</h3><p>持续监控的成本主要来自外部调用。三个可选策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>定期全量拉取</strong>：按统一周期（如每日或每周）拉取所有订阅主体的快照。实现简单，成本随商家数量线性增长，且延迟由周期决定。</li>\n<li><strong>增量/事件推送</strong>：优先使用登记机关或数据商提供的变更推送（webhook / delta 文件）。延迟低、成本低，但<strong>覆盖率取决于数据商是否提供</strong>，且推送本身也会丢。</li>\n<li><strong>混合</strong>：事件推送为主，定期全量兜底。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>混合策略的必要性在于：任何推送通道都会出现漏推，而漏推的表现是&quot;什么都没发生&quot;，与&quot;确实没变化&quot;不可区分。<strong>定期全量兜底是把&quot;静默漏推&quot;转化为&quot;可检测延迟&quot;的唯一手段。</strong> 兜底周期可以长（如 30 天），但必须有。</p>\n<h3 id=\"diff-的正确粒度\">Diff 的正确粒度</h3><p>对比两份快照时，比较必须在<strong>归一化之后</strong>进行，否则会产生大量假变更：名称的大小写与标点变化、地址的格式变化、日期的时区表示差异都会触发无效事件。归一化的规则必须与 <a href=\"../business-identity-verification/operating-address-presence-check\">经营地址/实际场所核验</a> 使用的规则一致，否则同一份数据在两处得到不同结论。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE registry_snapshot (&#10;  snapshot_id     BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  legal_entity_key TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  source          TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  fetched_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  payload_norm    JSONB NOT NULL,      -- 归一化后的字段&#10;  payload_raw_ref TEXT NOT NULL,       -- 原始报文存放位置&#10;  content_hash    TEXT NOT NULL,       -- payload_norm 的规范化哈希&#10;  UNIQUE (legal_entity_key, source, content_hash)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE registry_change_event (&#10;  event_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  legal_entity_key TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  from_snapshot_id BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES registry_snapshot(snapshot_id),&#10;  to_snapshot_id   BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES registry_snapshot(snapshot_id),&#10;  field_path      TEXT NOT NULL,       -- &#39;status&#39; | &#39;officers[2].name&#39; | ...&#10;  old_value       JSONB,&#10;  new_value       JSONB,&#10;  change_class    TEXT NOT NULL,       -- &#39;status&#39;|&#39;identity&#39;|&#39;control&#39;|&#39;scope&#39;|&#39;address&#39;&#10;  detected_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  processed_at    TIMESTAMPTZ&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> registry_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  snapshot_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  legal_entity_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fetched_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payload_norm    JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 归一化后的字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payload_raw_ref </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 原始报文存放位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  content_hash    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- payload_norm 的规范化哈希</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (legal_entity_key, source, content_hash)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> registry_change_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  legal_entity_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  from_snapshot_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> registry_snapshot(snapshot_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  to_snapshot_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> registry_snapshot(snapshot_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  field_path      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'status' | 'officers[2].name' | ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  old_value       JSONB,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  new_value       JSONB,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  change_class    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'status'|'identity'|'control'|'scope'|'address'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  detected_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  processed_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>content_hash</code> 上建唯一约束，使&quot;内容未变的重复拉取&quot;不产生新快照——这是控制存储增长的关键。没有它，日更十年会积累数千个等价快照。</p>\n<h3 id=\"乱序与重复\">乱序与重复</h3><p>变更事件可能乱序到达（先收到 8 月的快照再收到 7 月的），也可能重复。处理原则是<strong>以快照的 <code>fetched_at</code> 排序而不是以到达时间排序</strong>，并且事件生成本身应当是<strong>幂等的纯函数</strong>：同一对 (from_snapshot, to_snapshot) 只能生成一组事件，重复触发不产生重复行（靠 <code>content_hash</code> 唯一约束与事件表的去重键保证）。</p>\n<p>幂等在这里的具体含义值得写清楚：一个操作是幂等的，指的是它可以被应用多次而不改变结果（&quot;the ability of a system to produce the same outcome, even if the same file, event or message is received more than once&quot;），因此&quot;操作可以在必要时反复重复或重试而不引起非预期效果&quot;（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Idempotence\">Idempotence</a>）。在变更检测的场景里，这意味着<strong>消费同一条变更事件两次必须产生同样的重审结果</strong>——由于重审会触发外送筛查这类有外部副作用的动作，事件消费的幂等键必须一直传到那些动作上，否则漏推重放会变成重复筛查甚至重复计费。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重审的深度匹配\">重审的深度匹配</h2><h3 id=\"按变更类型选深度\">按变更类型选深度</h3><p>重审深度必须与变更类型匹配——全部走全量重审会让成本不可承受，全部走轻量重审会漏掉关键变化。映射关系应当是<strong>显式配置的规则表</strong>，而不是散落在代码里的 if-else：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rescreen_policy&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;change_class&quot;: &quot;status&quot;,&#10;      &quot;new_value_in&quot;: [&quot;struck_off&quot;, &quot;dissolved&quot;],&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: &quot;heavy&quot;,&#10;      &quot;effects&quot;: [&quot;suspend_payout&quot;, &quot;delist&quot;, &quot;notify_risk&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;change_class&quot;: &quot;status&quot;,&#10;      &quot;new_value_in&quot;: [&quot;insolvency_process&quot;],&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: &quot;medium&quot;,&#10;      &quot;effects&quot;: [&quot;flag_review&quot;, &quot;restrict_new_listings&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    { &quot;change_class&quot;: &quot;control&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;medium&quot;, &quot;effects&quot;: [&quot;rerun_ubo&quot;, &quot;rescreen_new_persons&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;change_class&quot;: &quot;scope&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;medium&quot;, &quot;effects&quot;: [&quot;recompute_category_scope&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;change_class&quot;: &quot;address&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;medium&quot;, &quot;effects&quot;: [&quot;recheck_address&quot;, &quot;rescreen&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;change_class&quot;: &quot;identity&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;light&quot;, &quot;effects&quot;: [&quot;update_profile&quot;] }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rescreen_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"change_class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"new_value_in\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"struck_off\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dissolved\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"heavy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"effects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"suspend_payout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"delist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"notify_risk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"change_class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"new_value_in\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"insolvency_process\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"effects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"flag_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"restrict_new_listings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"change_class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"control\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"effects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rerun_ubo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rescreen_new_persons\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"change_class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"effects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recompute_category_scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"change_class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"address\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"effects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recheck_address\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rescreen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"change_class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"identity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"light\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"effects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"update_profile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>effects</code> 与 <code>action</code> 分离是刻意的：同一深度（如 medium）在不同变更类型下触发不同的下游动作。把动作绑在深度上会迫使系统为每种动作组合发明一个新深度等级，最终退化成一堆特例。</p>\n<h3 id=\"重审的收敛条件\">重审的收敛条件</h3><p>重审不是重做全部核验——它只需要重做<strong>受变更影响的那部分</strong>及其下游。例如经营范围变更只需重跑 <a href=\"../business-identity-verification/charter-business-scope-match\">公司章程/经营范围与开店类目比对</a> 的映射与差异类目的处置；控制结构变更需要重跑穿透、重筛新增人员，但不必重验银行账户。</p>\n<p>判断&quot;哪些下游需要重跑&quot;的关系，本质上是<strong>尽调档案内部的依赖图</strong>。这也解释了为什么前八篇一再强调各项结论要带版本引用（<code>mapping_version</code>、<code>resolution_id</code>、<code>engine_version</code>）：没有引用关系，就无法确定变更的传播边界。</p>\n<h3 id=\"重审的失败处理\">重审的失败处理</h3><p>重审过程中外部数据源可能不可用。这时的行为必须明确：<strong>重审失败不是重审通过</strong>。处于 <code>rescreen_failed</code> 状态的案例应当保持上一次的结论有效，但在档案上标记&quot;结论已过期未复核&quot;，并按风险档决定是否收紧权限（高风险商家收紧，低风险商家维持）。把数据源故障当作通过的默认值，会在数据源长时间不可用时产生一批未经复核仍在经营的高风险商家。</p>\n<h2 id=\"监控的健康度\">监控的健康度</h2><h3 id=\"必须被监控的监控\">必须被监控的监控</h3><p>持续监控本身是一个长期运行的服务，它需要一个健康度指标集，否则&quot;监控坏了&quot;这件事不会被发现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>订阅覆盖率</strong>：应被订阅的主体数 vs 实际被订阅的主体数。缺口通常来自历史数据迁移或审批流程的遗漏分支。</li>\n<li><strong>检查新鲜度</strong>：<code>now() - last_checked_at</code> 的分布。长尾过长说明拉取任务在部分主体上失败。</li>\n<li><strong>事件处理延迟</strong>：从 <code>detected_at</code> 到 <code>processed_at</code> 的分布。延迟拉长意味着重审队列积压。</li>\n<li><strong>未处理事件数</strong>：处于 <code>processed_at IS NULL</code> 的事件数。持续增长说明消费端挂了。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE last_checked_at &lt; now() - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;) AS stale_subscriptions,&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE subscribed_at IS NULL)                       AS missing_subscriptions,&#10;  PERCENTILE_CONT(0.95) WITHIN GROUP (&#10;    ORDER BY EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (processed_at - detected_at))&#10;  ) FILTER (WHERE processed_at IS NOT NULL)                           AS p95_event_lag_sec,&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE processed_at IS NULL)                        AS pending_events&#10;FROM merchant_monitor_subscription s&#10;LEFT JOIN registry_change_event e USING (legal_entity_key);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_checked_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stale_subscriptions,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscribed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> missing_subscriptions,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  PERCENTILE_CONT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EXTRACT(EPOCH </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (processed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> detected_at))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> processed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p95_event_lag_sec,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> processed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pending_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merchant_monitor_subscription s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> registry_change_event e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (legal_entity_key);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这四类指标共同回答一个问题：<strong>&quot;如果没有变化&quot;和&quot;监控失效了&quot;，我们能否区分？</strong> 不能区分，就等于没有监控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>持续监控的本质是<strong>订阅 → 变化检测 → 重审</strong>三步；订阅的字段清单决定漏检率，其中<strong>人员与控制结构的变更必须触发重筛</strong>（筛查结论只在时点有效）。</li>\n<li>&quot;存续状态&quot;必须在平台侧映射到受控词表（active / dormant_legal / insolvency_process / dissolved / struck_off / <strong>unknown</strong>），因为不同管辖区的状态枚举法律含义不对应，<code>dormant</code> 在有些地方是合法正常状态。</li>\n<li>变化检测以<strong>快照 + <code>content_hash</code> 唯一约束</strong>实现幂等与去重；diff 必须在归一化之后进行；采用<strong>事件推送为主、定期全量兜底</strong>的混合策略，因为漏推与&quot;确实无变化&quot;不可区分。</li>\n<li>重审深度按<strong>显式规则表</strong>匹配变更类型，<code>action</code>（深度）与 <code>effects</code>（下游动作）分离；重审只需重做受影响的子图，这要求结论间有版本引用关系。</li>\n<li><strong>重审失败不等于重审通过</strong>：保持上次结论但标记&quot;已过期未复核&quot;，并按风险档决定是否收紧权限。</li>\n<li>监控自身需要健康度指标（订阅覆盖率、检查新鲜度、事件处理延迟、未处理事件数），其共同目的是区分&quot;没有变化&quot;与&quot;监控失效&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"工商变更/存续状态持续监控与重审","id":"工商变更-存续状态持续监控与重审"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"订阅什么：字段清单决定漏检率","id":"订阅什么-字段清单决定漏检率"},{"level":3,"text":"必订字段与变更后果","id":"必订字段与变更后果"},{"level":3,"text":"存续状态的取值语义","id":"存续状态的取值语义"},{"level":2,"text":"变化检测：快照 diff 的工程细节","id":"变化检测-快照-diff-的工程细节"},{"level":3,"text":"拉取频率与成本","id":"拉取频率与成本"},{"level":3,"text":"Diff 的正确粒度","id":"diff-的正确粒度"},{"level":3,"text":"乱序与重复","id":"乱序与重复"},{"level":2,"text":"重审的深度匹配","id":"重审的深度匹配"},{"level":3,"text":"按变更类型选深度","id":"按变更类型选深度"},{"level":3,"text":"重审的收敛条件","id":"重审的收敛条件"},{"level":3,"text":"重审的失败处理","id":"重审的失败处理"},{"level":2,"text":"监控的健康度","id":"监控的健康度"},{"level":3,"text":"必须被监控的监控","id":"必须被监控的监控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"KYB 风险分级与入驻审批/补件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-kyb-business-verification/business-account-qualification/kyb-risk-tier-approval"},"next":{"title":"商家异常/停业/吊销联动（联047/110）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-kyb-business-verification/kyb-monitoring-lifecycle/merchant-status-dormancy-revocation"}}